{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55904","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十一 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一切名山到因脚，辛苦年深与袜着。\n如今年老不能行，手里把个破木杓。\n破木杓，俵与衆生甘露药。\n衆生吃了尽惺惺，一切昏迷皆失却。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}